{
"type": 1,
"text": "<attachments>\n<attachment id=\"file:Initialize-ProGetWithPagootle .ps1\">\nUser's active selection, this should be the main focus:\nExcerpt from Initialize-ProGetWithPagootle .ps1, lines 1 to 1:\n`powershell\n# filepath: c:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\ATAP.Utilities\\src\\ATAP.Utilities.IAC.Ansible.Powershell\\public\\Initialize-ProGetWithPagootle .ps1\nInitialize-ProGetWithPagootle\n`\n</attachment>\n<attachment>\nUser's active file for additional context:\n```powershell\n# filepath: c:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\ATAP.Utilities\\src\\ATAP.Utilities.IAC.Ansible.Powershell\\public\\Initialize-ProGetWithPagootle .ps1\nfunction Initialize-ProGetWithPagootle {\n  param(\n    [Parameter(Mandatory)][string]$Server,\n    [Parameter(Mandatory)][string]$ApiKey\n  )\n\n  # Set connection\n  Set-ProGetConnection -Uri $Server -ApiKey $ApiKey\n\n  # Define feeds\n  $feeds = @(\n    @{ Name = \"choco-internal-upload\"; Type = \"chocolatey\"; Desc = \"Internal Chocolatey Upload\" },\n    @{ Name = \"choco-external-upload\"; Type = \"chocolatey\"; Desc = \"External Chocolatey Upload\" },\n    @{ Name = \"choco-internal-approved\"; Type = \"chocolatey\"; Desc = \"Internal Chocolatey Approved\" },\n    @{ Name = \"choco-external-approved\"; Type = \"chocolatey\"; Desc = \"External Chocolatey Approved\" },\n    @{ Name = \"ps-internal-upload\"; Type = \"powershell\"; Desc = \"Internal PowerShell Upload\" },\n    @{ Name = \"ps-external-upload\"; Type = \"powershell\"; Desc = \"External PowerShell Upload\" },\n    @{ Name = \"ps-internal-approved\"; Type = \"powershell\"; Desc = \"Internal PowerShell Approved\" },\n    @{ Name = \"ps-external-approved\"; Type = \"powershell\"; Desc = \"External PowerShell Approved\" }\n  )\n\n  foreach ($feed in $feeds) {\n    Write-Host \"Creating feed: $($feed.Name)\"\n    New-ProGetFeed -Name $feed.Name -FeedType $feed.Type -Description $feed.Desc\n\n    $apiKeyName = \"key-$($feed.Name)\"\n    $apiKeyValue = (New-Guid).Guid.Replace(\"-\", \"\")\n\n    Write-Host \"Creating API key for feed $($feed.Name)\"\n    New-ProGetApiKey -Key $apiKeyValue `\n -Description \"API key for $($feed.Name)\" `\n      -Feed $feed.Name `\n -Permissions @(\"ViewPackages\", \"DownloadPackages\", \"PublishPackages\", \"DeletePackages\", \"PromotePackages\")\n\n $envVarName = \"PROGET_APIKEY_$($feed.Name.Replace('-', '_').ToUpper())\"\n [System.Environment]::SetEnvironmentVariable($envVarName, $apiKeyValue, [System.EnvironmentVariableTarget]::User)\n    Write-Host \"Stored API key in $envVarName\"\n  }\n\n  # Add PSGallery connector to ps-external-upload\n  Write-Host \"Adding PSGallery connector to ps-external-upload\"\n  New-ProGetConnector -Feed \"ps-external-upload\" `\n    -Name \"PSGallery\" `\n    -Url \"https://www.powershellgallery.com/api/v2\"\n\n  # Create feed group for approved feeds\n  Write-Host \"Creating feed group 'approved-group'\"\n  New-ProGetGroup -Name \"approved-group\"\n\n  Add-ProGetGroupFeed -Group \"approved-group\" -Feed \"choco-internal-approved\"\n  Add-ProGetGroupFeed -Group \"approved-group\" -Feed \"choco-external-approved\"\n  Add-ProGetGroupFeed -Group \"approved-group\" -Feed \"ps-internal-approved\"\n  Add-ProGetGroupFeed -Group \"approved-group\" -Feed \"ps-external-approved\"\n\n  Write-Host \"✅ ProGet setup complete with Pagootle.\"\n}\n```\n</attachment>\n\n</attachments>\n<reminder>\nWhen using the insert_edit_into_file tool, avoid repeating existing code, instead use a line comment with \\`...existing code...\\` to represent regions of unchanged code.\nWhen suggesting to create new files, pick a location inside `c:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\ATAP.Utilities\\src\\ATAP.Utilities.IAC.Ansible.Powershell`.\n</reminder>\n<prompt>\nthroughout this function Change Write-Host \"Some-string\" to     Write-PSFMessage -Level Debug -Message \"some-string\" -Tag 'Trace', 'Initialize-ProGetWithPagootle'\r\n\n</prompt>\n"
            },
