"markdownBeforeBlock": "You cannot invoke PowerShell script blocks directly from .NET event handlers because they run on background threads without a PowerShell runspace, which causes the error you saw. \n**However, you can queue the lines in the event handler and use a timer or loop in your main runspace to process them as they arrive, without waiting for process exit.**\n\nHere’s how you can do it:\n\n"
