"toolCallRounds": [
{
"response": "The error `[ref] cannot be applied to a variable that does not exist` occurs because `$line` and `$errLine` are not initialized before being used as `[ref]` parameters in `TryDequeue`.\n\n**Fix:** \nInitialize `$line` and `$errLine` before using them with `[ref]`.\n\nHere’s how to fix your code:\n\n`powershell\n// filepath: c:\\Dropbox\\whertzing\\GitHub\\ATAP.Utilities\\src\\ATAP.Utilities.IAC.Ansible.Powershell\\public\\Get-ChocolateyPackagesNeedingUpdate.ps1\n...existing code...\n    while (-not $process.HasExited) {\n      $line = $null\n      while ($outputQueue.TryDequeue([ref]$line)) {\n        & $ProcessLine $line\n        $line = $null\n      }\n      $errLine = $null\n      while ($errorQueue.TryDequeue([ref]$errLine)) {\n        Write-PSFMessage -Level Warning -Message \"Choco warning: $errLine\" -Tag 'Trace', 'Get-ChocolateyPackagesNeedingUpdate'\n        $errLine = $null\n      }\n      Start-Sleep -Milliseconds 100\n    }\n\n    # Process any remaining lines after exit\n    $line = $null\n    while ($outputQueue.TryDequeue([ref]$line)) {\n      & $ProcessLine $line\n      $line = $null\n    }\n    $errLine = $null\n    while ($errorQueue.TryDequeue([ref]$errLine)) {\n      Write-PSFMessage -Level Warning -Message \"Choco warning: $errLine\" -Tag 'Trace', 'Get-ChocolateyPackagesNeedingUpdate'\n      $errLine = $null\n    }\n...existing code...\n`\n\n**Summary:** \n- Always initialize `$line` and `$errLine` to `$null` before using `[ref]$line` and `[ref]$errLine` in `TryDequeue`. \n- Reset them to `$null` after each use in the loop.\n\nThis will resolve the error and allow your code to process lines as they arrive.",
